{"code":"304840","name":"피플바이오","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리장비와용품","sector_desc":"의료기기·진단기기·의료용품. 수출 비중이 높고 인허가와 해외 판매 성과가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2002년 설립된 변형단백질질환 혈액진단제품 개발 및 제조 기업으로, 2020년 기술성장기업으로 코스닥에 상장함. 주력 제품은 알츠하이머병 조기진단 혈액검사 제품이며, 자체 개발한 SI-MDS 기술의 올리고머화 베타-아밀로이드 검사 제품 알츠온을 공급하고 있음. 동사는 MDS 원천특허를 기반으로 파킨슨병, 당뇨병, 대장암 등 다양한 진단 파이프라인을 확장하고, 병원과 연구기관과 공동연구개발 네트워크를 구축하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":561.0,"open":561.0,"high":561.0,"low":561.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":-21.5385,"ret_120":-58.3828,"ret_250":-62.0433,"ma20":561.0,"ma60":562.35,"ma120":774.5333,"ma200":882.85,"close_vs_ma200":-36.4558,"close_vs_ma60":-0.2401,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-5.4261,"r2_60":0.0617,"slope_120":-87.2185,"r2_120":0.8486,"slope_250":-67.6047,"r2_250":0.7136,"high52":2245.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":24.9889,"dd_52w":-75.0111,"mdd_1y":-72.1588,"atr14_pct":42.8571,"vol_ann_60":30.8261,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":10990674.4,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":34.5332,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":80574.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.3313,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3313,"frgn_net_120":-46338.0,"inst_net_120":-18362.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1905,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0755,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.266,"foreign_ratio":1.01,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.23,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-7.0,"op_margin_q":-41.1765,"op_qoq":53.3333,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":58.8235,"rev_yoy":142.8571,"op_trend_4q":29.3333,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-93.51,"debt_ratio":282.6,"per":null,"pbr":0.48,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.01,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"n